## Standing directives

Durable instructions the user has given that bind every agent. One per line, dated, in the
imperative. Not a task list — a task belongs in the inbox or on the roadmap.

- `<YYYY-MM-DD>` — `<TODO: e.g. "never touch production data without asking, even for a read">`

> **When a directive stops being true, delete it.** This file is a snapshot of what binds *now*: it is
> overwritten like a `STATUS`, not appended like a log. A retired directive that stays here is a rule
> nobody meant and everybody obeys.
